HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ddcc device driver first appeared in FreeBSD 4.0.  OpenBSD support was
     added in OpenBSD 2.7.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     The ddcc driver was written by Bill Paul <_w_p_a_u_l_@_e_e_._c_o_l_u_m_b_i_a_._e_d_u> and ported
